  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注) １．取締役&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;吉永泰之氏、&lt;/span&gt;富永由加里氏、中村寛氏および池田隆之氏は、社外取締役です。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;２．監査役山本眞弓および&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;森居達郎&lt;/span&gt;の両氏は、社外監査役です。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
